{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_79_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_79","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_79_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_79","textTraditional":"十有六年春王正月戊申朔，隕石于宋五。是月，六鷁退飛，過宋都。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_79_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_79","textTraditional":"三月壬申，公子季友卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_79_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_79","textTraditional":"夏四月丙申，鄫季姬卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_79_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_79","textTraditional":"秋七月甲子，公孫茲卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_79_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_79","textTraditional":"冬十有二月，公會齊侯、宋公、陳侯、衛侯、鄭伯、許男、邢侯、曹伯于淮。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_79_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_79","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_79_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_79","textTraditional":"十六年春，隕石于宋五，隕星也。六鷁退飛，過宋都，風也。周內史叔興聘于宋，宋襄公問焉，曰；「是何祥也？吉凶焉在？」對曰：「今茲魯多大喪，明年齊有亂，君將得諸侯而不終。」退而告人曰：「君失問。是陰陽之事，非吉凶所生也。吉凶由人，吾不敢逆君故也。」","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_79_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_79","textTraditional":"夏，齊伐厲不克，救徐而還。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_79_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_79","textTraditional":"秋，狄侵晉，取狐、廚、受鐸，涉汾，及昆都，因晉敗也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_79_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_79","textTraditional":"王以戎難告于齊，齊徵諸侯而戍周。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_79_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_79","textTraditional":"冬十一月乙卯，鄭殺子華。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_79_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_79","textTraditional":"十二月會于淮，謀鄶，且東略也。城鄫，役人病。有夜登丘而呼曰：「齊有亂。」不果城而還。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}